1
00:00:02,139 --> 00:00:04,788
As Uke comes to grab your wrists with both hands

2
00:00:05,089 --> 00:00:06,426
extend towards him

3
00:00:06,727 --> 00:00:10,159
then using his momentum lead Uke´s body round 
in a big circle,

4
00:00:10,160 --> 00:00:12,910
at the same time grabbing his wrist and fingers,

5
00:00:13,211 --> 00:00:16,226
control his wrist drawing in towards your center,

6
00:00:16,727 --> 00:00:18,480
as you do so cut down,

7
00:00:18,481 --> 00:00:21,308
follow Uke´s body round controlling his shoulder

8
00:00:22,509 --> 00:00:23,541
Then sit down

9
00:00:23,542 --> 00:00:25,541
placing his shoulder in between the knees

10
00:00:25,842 --> 00:00:27,877
controlling his wrist with your opposite arm

11
00:00:27,878 --> 00:00:29,346
holding him tight against the body

12
00:00:29,347 --> 00:00:31,768
turning your body towards his head for the pin.

